1
00:00:00,708 --> 00:00:03,138
(Raj:)How's that Hater-ade
taste, bro?

2
00:00:04,512 --> 00:00:06,212
(Raj:)Hey, this isn't
the way to work.

3
00:00:06,213 --> 00:00:09,283
(Howard:)I just want to pop in
and make sure Ma's okay.

4
00:00:09,283 --> 00:00:10,953
(Raj:)I thought Stuart
was looking after her.

5
00:00:10,951 --> 00:00:14,391
(Howard:)He was, but now that her cast
is off, he moved out.

6
00:00:14,388 --> 00:00:15,918
(Howard:)And honestly, I'm kind of glad.

7
00:00:15,923 --> 00:00:17,353
(Howard:)It was getting a little weird.

8
00:00:17,358 --> 00:00:18,658
(Raj:)How so?

9
00:00:18,659 --> 00:00:19,759
(Howard:)I don't know,
they're...

10
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:22,430
(Howard:)chummy.

11
00:00:22,429 --> 00:00:24,029
(Raj:)Like us?

12
00:00:24,031 --> 00:00:25,601
(Howard:)No, not like us.

13
00:00:25,599 --> 00:00:26,969
(Howard:)Creepy chummy,

14
00:00:26,967 --> 00:00:29,237
(Howard:)like you and your dog.

15
00:00:29,236 --> 00:00:32,706
(Raj:)She feeds him out
of her own mouth?

16
00:00:33,908 --> 00:00:36,108
(Howard:)I mean, he calls
her Debbie,

17
00:00:36,110 --> 00:00:38,280
(Howard:)she calls
him Stewie

18
00:00:38,279 --> 00:00:39,949
(Howard:)and they're all giggly
around each other.

19
00:00:39,947 --> 00:00:42,017
(Howard:)And believe me,
when food goes in that mouth,

20
00:00:42,016 --> 00:00:43,716
(Howard:)it does not come out.

21
00:00:43,717 --> 00:00:45,647
(Raj:)So are you worried

22
00:00:45,653 --> 00:00:48,423
(Raj:)because he's replacing you
as a son

23
00:00:48,422 --> 00:00:51,222
(Raj:)or are you worried because
he's becoming her lover?

24
00:00:51,225 --> 00:00:53,895
(Howard:)First of all, no one can
replace me as a son.

25
00:00:53,894 --> 00:00:55,424
(Howard:)I'm her little matzo ball.

26
00:00:55,429 --> 00:00:57,359
(Howard:)And secondly,

27
00:00:57,364 --> 00:00:58,994
(Howard:)my mother is well past

28
00:00:58,999 --> 00:01:01,529
(Howard:)having any kind of sex life.

